{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01917kzUe2WQYDU8W3zy7iwS","type":"tool_result","content":"=== README.md\n# nightly-review (snapshot of my home dir, the relevant bits)$\n$\nA launchd user agent runs `bin/nightly-review.zsh` every night at 02:30. The$\nscript asks a headless coding agent to review yesterday's commits in$\n~/projects/shop and sends me the summary (or a failure note) over Telegram$\nvia `bin/notify.sh`.$\n$\nLayout, relative to my home:$\n$\n- `Library/LaunchAgents/com.vk.nightly-review.plist` M-bM-^@M-^T loaded with$\n  `launchctl bootstrap gui/$UID ...` on 2026-10-12$\n- `bin/nightly-review.zsh` M-bM-^@M-^T the job$\n- `bin/notify.sh` M-bM-^@M-^T Telegram notifier (works when run by hand)$\n- `Library/Logs/` M-bM-^@M-^T where the plist points stdout/stderr$\n- `launchctl-print.txt` M-bM-^@M-^T output of `launchctl print gui/501/com.vk.nightly-review`, captured 2026-10-18 09:10$\n$\nI have received nothing on Telegram since it was loaded: no summaries, no$\nfailure notes.$\n=== launchctl-print.txt\ngui/501/com.vk.nightly-review = {$\n^Iactive count = 0$\n^Ipath = /Users/vk/Library/LaunchAgents/com.vk.nightly-review.plist$\n^Itype = LaunchAgent$\n^Istate = waiting$\n$\n^Iprogram = /bin/zsh$\n^Iarguments = {$\n^I^I/bin/zsh$\n^I^I/Users/vk/bin/nightly-review.zsh$\n^I}$\n$\n^Istdout path = /Users/vk/Library/Logs/nightly-review.out$\n^Istderr path = /Users/vk/Library/Logs/nightly-review.err$\n^Idefault environment = {$\n^I^IPATH => /usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin$\n^I}$\n$\n^Ienvironment = {$\n^I^IPATH => /opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin$\n^I^IXPC_SERVICE_NAME => com.vk.nightly-review$\n^I}$\n$\n^Idomain = gui/501 [100005]$\n^Iminimum runtime = 10$\n^Iexit timeout = 5$\n^Iruns = 6$\n^Ilast exit code = 1$\n$\n^Ievent triggers = {$\n^I^Icom.vk.nightly-review.StartCalendarInterval => {$\n^I^I^Ikeep alive = 0$\n^I^I^Iservice = com.vk.nightly-review$\n^I^I^Iname = com.vk.nightly-review.StartCalendarInterval$\n^I^I^Idescriptor = {$\n^I^I^I^I\"Hour\" => 2$\n^I^I^I^I\"Minute\" => 30$\n^I^I^I}$\n^I^I}$\n^I}$\n$\n^Ispawn type = daemon (3)$\n^Iproperties = {$\n^I^Ipartial import = 0$\n^I^Ilaunchd bundle = 0$\n^I^Itrusted = 0$\n^I^Ion demand = 1$\n^I}$\n}$\n=== bin/nightly-review.zsh\n#!/bin/zsh$\n# Nightly review of yesterday's commits, summary to Telegram.$\nset -u$\n$\nREPO=\"$HOME/projects/shop\"$\nOUT=\"$HOME/Library/Logs/nightly-review-$(date +%F).md\"$\nNOTIFY=\"$HOME/bin/notify.sh\"$\n$\nSINCE=$(date -v-1d +%F)$\nPROMPT=\"Review the commits in this repository since $SINCE.$\nFor each commit: one line on what it changes and whether anything looks risky$\n(migrations, auth, payments, deleted tests).$\nEnd with a three-line summary I can read on my phone.$\nDo not modify any file.\"$\n$\ncd \"$REPO\" || { \"$NOTIFY\" \"nightly review: repo missing\"; exit 1; }$\n$\nclaude -p \"$PROMPT\" --output-format text > \"$OUT\"$\nstatus=$?$\n$\nif [ $status -ne 0 ]; then$\n  \"$NOTIFY\" \"nightly review FAILED (exit $status), see $OUT\"$\n  exit $status$\nfi$\n$\n\"$NOTIFY\" \"nightly review done: $(head -c 300 \"$OUT\")\"$\n=== bin/notify.sh\n#!/bin/bash$\n# usage: notify.sh \"message\"  M-bM-^@M-^T sends a Telegram message to me.$\nset -eu$\n: \"${TG_BOT_TOKEN:=$(security find-generic-password -s tg-bot -w)}\"$\nCHAT_ID=123456789$\ncurl -sS -X POST \"https://api.telegram.org/bot${TG_BOT_TOKEN}/sendMessage\" \\$\n  -d chat_id=\"$CHAT_ID\" --data-urlencode text=\"$1\" > /dev/null$\n=== Library/Logs/nightly-review.err\nNot logged in M-BM-7 Please run /login$\n/Users/vk/bin/nightly-review.zsh:19: read-only variable: status$\nNot logged in M-BM-7 Please run /login$\n/Users/vk/bin/nightly-review.zsh:19: read-only variable: status$\nNot logged in M-BM-7 Please run /login$\n/Users/vk/bin/nightly-review.zsh:19: read-only variable: status$\nNot logged in M-BM-7 Please run /login$\n/Users/vk/bin/nightly-review.zsh:19: read-only variable: status$\nNot logged in M-BM-7 Please run /login$\n/Use